..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : AKT.PM.TRANSACTIONDATA
.. Date           : 14.04.16
.. Version        : 1.0
.. Author         : mage
.. Functionality  : Loads process data for project management
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   :
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
..
..*****************************************************************************
.type text xterrdat xtsys
.. 20170711 MiMi (GmbH) definition xdat 
.type text xtdat ? _defined(xtdat)
..
.formula U|xterrdat = "tmp/XPM.IMP.IMPORT.ERR"
.formula U|xtsys = "owinstall/abas-pm/./ps.import.transactiondata.sh -p master 2>" + U|xterrdat
.. Import process data for project management
.system 'U|xtsys' background
..
.. clean up when we don't have errors
.formula U|xtcom = "rm -f " + 'U|xtdat' + " " + 'U|xterrdat'            ?  (F|filesize(U|xterrdat) = 0)
.system 'U|xtcom' background                                            ?  (F|filesize(U|xterrdat) = 0)
.continue
